<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were uneven, generally $0.25 lower. Trading slow. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   56.50-57.00,</p>
<p>near 200 head US 1-2 57.50-58.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 1.00 lower. Top 52.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-400 lbs    47.50</p>
<p>	    400-450 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    50.00-52.00</p>
